41	     * normalized last name and address (trimmed, lower-cased, whitespace collapsed).
42	     * Every owner sharing a household therefore receives the same identifier: the first
43	     * eight upper-case hex characters of the SHA-256 of '&lt;lastName&gt;|&lt;address&gt;'.
44	     */
45	    default String householdId(Owner owner) {
46	        String key = normalizeHouseholdKey(owner.getLastName()) + "|"
